      "uuid": "f61d17a3-c64d-4ac7-87c9-926de20f7ddc",
      "title": "texto",
      "position": 1,
      "contentHtml": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\">Voc&ecirc; sabia que as publica&ccedil;&otilde;es do projeto&nbsp;<i style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">Ocupa&ccedil;&atilde;o</i> <i style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">Ita&uacute; Cultural</i> tamb&eacute;m est&atilde;o dispon&iacute;veis digitalmente, de forma gratuita? As homenagens que a institui&ccedil;&atilde;o fez a grandes nomes da cultura brasileira, como Paulo Freire, Dias Gomes, Dona Odete, Ailton Krenak e tantos outros, podem agora ser encontradas em diversas plataformas digitai<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: #231f20; background: white;\">Veja tamb&eacute;m:<o:p></o:p></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: #231f20; background: white;\">&gt;&gt; </span><a href=\"https://ocupacao.icnetworks.org/ocupacao/\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\">Conhe&ccedil;a, compreenda e celebre mais a vida, obra e hist&oacute;ria dos in&uacute;meros artistas que passaram pelo projeto</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\">As publica&ccedil;&otilde;es digitais est&atilde;o dispon&iacute;veis nas seguintes plataformas:&nbsp;<span style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Amazon</span>, <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Google Livros</span>, <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Skeelo</span>, <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Apple Books</span> e <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Toca Livros</span>. Entre os t&iacute;tulos que nelas j&aacute; podem ser encontrados, est&atilde;o:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><i style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: #222222; background: white;\">Ocupa&ccedil;&atilde;o Vladimir Herzog</span></i><i style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: #222222;\"> </span></i><i style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></i></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><i style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-fa